 it with this text applied? Note we will also need a treatment for the author attribution line. Quote below:  This universe itself unfolds in limitless spirals of adornment. Of what are the adornments of the universe? Of what are her necklaces? She is draped in galaxies that are draped in worlds that are draped in ranges that are draped in forests that are draped in branches that are draped in needles that are draped in infinite necklaces of December frost. Adorned in Summer lightness as the goddess Kali sang the hymns. The mother goddess they say, wears the whole universe as her ornament... -Universe, Adorned Joshua Michael Schrei","2:62290|1080|1920|1|u|0|2222|4|HighLight_IGStorySet-SeekingTheSublime-6","2:62298|1080|1920|1|u|0|2222|4|HighLight_IGStorySet-SeekingTheSublime-6","2:62305|1080|1920|1|u|0|2222|4|HighLight_IGStorySet-SeekingTheSublime-6","2:62312|1080|1920|1|u|0|2222|4|HighLight_IGStorySet-SeekingTheSublime-6","2:62319|1080|1920|1|u|0|2222|4|HighLight_IGStorySet-SeekingTheSublime-11","2:62327|1080|1920|1|u|0|2222|3|HighLight_IGStorySet-SeekingTheSublime-2","2:62335|1080|1920|1|u|0|2222|4|HighLight_IGStorySet-SeekingTheSublime-2","2:62343|1080|1920|1|u|0|2222|2|HighLight_IGStorySet-SeekingTheSublime-1","2:62349|1080|1920|1|u|0|2222|3|HighLight_IGStorySet-SeekingTheSublime-1","2:62359|1080|1920|1|u|0|2222|2|HighLight_IGStorySet-SanctuaryofSelf","2:62366|1080|1920|1|u|0|2222|2|HighLight_IGStorySet-SanctuaryofSelf","2:62373|1080|1920|1|u|0|2222|2|Instagram story - 31","2:62379|1080|1920|1|u|0|2222|3|HighLight_IGStorySet-SeekingTheSublime-3","2:62387|1080|1920|1|u|0|2222|2|HighLight_IGStorySet-SeekingTheSublime-3","2:62396|1080|1920|1|u|0|2222|2|HighLight_IGStorySet-SeekingTheSublime-3","2:62403|1080|1920|1|u|0|2222|2|HighLight_IGStorySet-SeekingTheSublime-3","2:62410|1080|1920|1|u|0|2222|4|HighLight_IGStorySet-SeekingTheSublime-3","2:62419|1080|1920|1|u|0|2222|3|HighLight_IGStorySet-SeekingTheSublime-4","2:62427|1080|1920|1|u|0|2222|4|HighLight_IGStorySet-S